# ============================================================
# ReachIQ — Cursor Rules
# Job Search Outreach Automation Platform
# Read this before every response. Follow every rule strictly.
# ============================================================

## PROJECT OVERVIEW
ReachIQ is a personal job search automation platform. It sends
personalized cold outreach emails to HR/recruiters, attaches a
resume PDF, and notifies the user on WhatsApp when someone replies.

## TECH STACK — NEVER DEVIATE FROM THIS
- Backend:      Python 3.11 + FastAPI
- Database:     PostgreSQL 15 via SQLAlchemy (sync, not async)
- Migrations:   Alembic
- Queue:        Celery + Redis (broker + result backend)
- AI:           Anthropic Claude API (claude-sonnet-4-20250514)
- Email:        Gmail API via google-auth + googleapiclient
- Notifications: Twilio WhatsApp API
- Frontend Web: React 18 + Vite + TailwindCSS
- Mobile:       React Native + Expo
- Containerized: Docker + docker-compose (Postgres + Redis + pgAdmin)

